      },
      {
        "text": "There is widespread ignorance among Americans regarding the historical experiences of AA and HPI communities in the United States.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The model minority myth leads to the perception that Asian Americans and Pacific Islanders are not true minorities.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Despite the model minority myth, there are significant numbers of struggling individuals within the AANHPI community.",
