        "text": "The military's job was to go in and kill Osama bin Laden and go after the terrorists who attacked us on 9/11.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "I have been arguing and calling for a review of what our objective was in Afghanistan.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "The military successfully killed Osama bin Laden and went after the terrorists responsible for 9/11.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "We did not achieve a strategic objective in Afghanistan.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Nation-building is not the military's responsibility.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "We did not know what the strategic objective was in Afghanistan.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Expecting the U.S. military to build a democratic nation over 20 years was foolhardy.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
